		(property "Note" "Pin 6 printed for O3 and GND. Printed pin number repeats on this symbol; suffix #2 added to keep pins distinct. O3 line drawn through an \"N/C\" note yet continues to RAW_SHUTO_T-. UDD unnumbered; pin 9 bubble input unnamed. U29 is also printed as MC93 gates on FIG 5A (ref clash)"
