		(property "Function" "Inferred from the circuit: serial latch on the NSP lines: O1 drives CST_DEL (the U43 switches), O3 drives RAW_SHUTO_T- (to FIG 5E); its SER.OUT continues the chain as NSP_SERI. NSP = non-volatile set point (service manual SF p.66 \"Dump Non-volatile set point parameters\"); the link to these parts is inferred"
